{"path":"io/basic_ios/exceptions","title":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::exceptions","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ios&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>exceptions","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/exceptions","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Gets and sets the exception mask of the stream. The exception mask determines which error states trigger exceptions of type failure.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><span class=\"kw1714\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">iostate</span></span></a> exceptions<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> exceptions<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><span class=\"kw1714\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">iostate</span></span></a> except <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Gets and sets the exception mask of the stream. The exception mask determines which error states trigger exceptions of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/failure\">failure</a></span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns the exception mask.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Sets the exception mask to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">except</span></code>. If the stream has an error state covered by the exception mask when called, an exception is immediately triggered.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> except\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> exception mask\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> The current exception mask.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> (none)</div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: discuss <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/lwg-active.html#2349\" data-external=\"1\">LWG2349</a> and link from ios_base::clear, and from (un)formatted(i/o)utputfunction requirement pages (or perhaps the behavior should be fully elaborated on the requirement pages and linked from here). See also <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/a/35089910\" data-external=\"1\">stackoverflow.com/a/35089910</a> </div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> ivalue<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">try</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ifstream\"><span class=\"kw1749\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ifstream</span></span></a> in<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"in.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        in.<span class=\"me1\">exceptions</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">ifstream</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">failbit</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// may throw</span>\n        in <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> ivalue<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// may throw</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">catch</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/failure\"><span class=\"kw1687\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">failure</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> fail<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"co1\">// handle exception here</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fail.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>basic_ios::clear: iostream error</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ios","title":"std::basic_ios"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::exceptions","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Gets and sets the exception mask of the stream."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"except"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The current exception mask."},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":157,"codeBlockCount":2}
